silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_23_summary_audit_residual_sections_01_summary_textbook_chapter_concrete_anchor_7_VetRecord#vetrecord silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord is the vet-clinic incoming evidence record; rho:VetRecord->Mittens, NOT a second cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetRecord', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
